    {
      "id": "cover",
      "paragraphs": [
        { "style": "title", "runs": [{ "text": "밤의 산책" }] },
        { "style": "title", "runs": [{ "text": "A Night Walk" }] },
        { "style": "caption", "runs": [{ "text": "A sample zine for Gino. Eight pages, A5, saddle-stitched on A4." }] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "essay",
      "paragraphs": [
        { "style": "body", "runs": [{ "text": "자정이 지나면 동네는 다른 얼굴을 보여준다. After midnight the neighbourhood shows another face: the shutters are down, the cats own the pavement, and the only light left on is the one over the bakery door, where the first loaves are already in the oven." }] },
        { "style": "body", "runs": [{ "text": "I walk because the day has been too loud. 낮이 너무 시끄러웠기 때문에 걷는다. The walk has no destination; it has a length, roughly an hour, and a shape, roughly a loop, and that is enough structure for a night." }] },
        { "style": "body", "runs": [{ "text": "골목 끝의 편의점은 언제나 열려 있다. The convenience store at the end of the lane is always open, a small aquarium of light. Someone is always inside, buying one thing, slowly, as if the buying were the point and the thing were incidental." }] },
        { "style": "body", "runs": [{ "text": "There is a bridge on the loop, and from the middle of it the river is black and quick. 다리 한가운데서 보면 강은 검고 빠르다. I stop there every time, for the same thirty seconds, and I could not tell you what I am looking at." }] },
        { "style": "body", "runs": [{ "text": "돌아오는 길에는 같은 집들이 다른 순서로 나타난다. On the way back the same houses appear in a different order, which is a small lesson in how much order does. By the time I reach my door the bakery has turned its sign around, and the day has started without me, which is exactly how I wanted it." }] },
        { "style": "body", "runs": [{ "text": "This story is threaded through four frames on pages two to five. 이 글은 2쪽부터 5쪽까지 네 개의 상자를 거쳐 흐른다. Move or resize any of them and the text reflows across all four; the last frame reports an overflow if the text no longer fits." }] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "picture_caption",
      "paragraphs": [
        { "style": "caption", "runs": [{ "text": "Sample picture, 1200 by 800 pixels, placed with fill. 그림 상자를 선택하고 Place image를 눌러 다른 그림으로 바꿔 보세요." }] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "back",
